            "description": {
              "content": "Returns all enterprises within scope of the `Access Token`, optionally filtered by enterprise identifiers and external identifiers. Note this operation uses [Pagination](https://mews-systems.gitbook.io/connector-api/guidelines/pagination/) and supports [Portfolio Access Tokens](https://mews-systems.gitbook.io/connector-api/concepts/multi-property/).",
